        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍌 The fruit are falling again... and they’re not alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations. You survived the fruitpocalypse. But now they’re back. And this time… they brought friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fruit Hoop 2</strong> is the mind-meltingly ridiculous sequel to the indie classic <i>Fruit Hoop</i>. You once again take control of a hoop—yes, just a hoop—on an eternal mission to catch falling produce and dodge anything that wants you dead. But now, there are more fruits. More hazards. More bananas. So many bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍊 <strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your hoop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the good stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the bad stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat until your hands hurt or your brain melts.<br>(Or both.)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🫐 <strong>Still Not Convinced?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s like <i>Frogger</i> had a baby with a blender.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal narrative, maximum vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for that “one more try” loop that ruins sleep schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions. Only macrofruit.</p></li></ul>",
